      787     end.
      788   end.
      789   assign
      790     varprice-base-cons = varprice-base-cons / varcons-qnty
      791     varprice-rubl-cons = varprice-rubl-cons / varcons-qnty.
      792   if varprice-base-cons = ? then do:
